==Battleground==
*2 [[Maawth]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Kroxo]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Kroxo]] spawns after 18 seconds<sup>540f</sup>.
*1 [[Kroxo]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Kroxo]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Kroxo]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Kroxo]] spawns after 46 seconds<sup>1,380f</sup>.
*1 [[Kroxo]] spawns after 48 seconds<sup>1,440f</sup>.
*1 [[Kroxo]] spawns after 49.33 seconds<sup>1,480f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[LeMurr]] spawns.
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Generally, any lineup that can beat the previous stages can clean house here. The only potential challenge is Nimoy Bore, who may need crowd-controllers to subdue. Seafarer and others, however, can easily take care of this issue, especially since Nimoy Bore only appears on base-hit and has relatively low stats. The other enemies here barely pose a threat whatsoever.

